# C++ gameplay

- Module is `Anastasis_UnrealV2`. Match existing First Person / Horror / Shooter variant layout.
- Prefer `UCLASS`/`UFUNCTION` reflection for anything an agent or Blueprint must see.
- New AI-callable editor tools belong in Python toolsets unless the API is missing from Python stubs (`Intermediate/PythonStub/unreal.py` after Developer Mode).
- Do not generate Live Coding / Intermediate build noise as “fixes”.
